; Every shape the LSP's schema-aware surfaces now resolve slot-locally,
; replayed on the validator so the four hosts agree about what each one
; means.
;
; `canvas.:shape` declares local `circle` (`:r`), `rect` (`:w :h`) and
; `group` (whose `:child` nests a local `dot`); a *global* `circle`
; requiring `:radius` sits beside them to be shadowed, and a global
; `line` to be reached by the additive fallback.
;
; The validator has always read this slot local-first. The LSP did not:
; it resolved every head against the global catalog, so hover on the
; local `circle` printed the global's card, `:radius` and all, and the
; head completion offered a snippet the validator rejects. Silence would
; have been recoverable; a confident wrong answer was not.
;
; Sibling of `local-form-shadows-global` and friends, which pin one rule
; each from the legacy schema+input shape. This case is the *table* — one
; document carrying the whole set, which is what an editor faces.
(plugin :name lf :version "1.0.0"
  (form :name canvas
    (key :name shape :type form
      (form :name circle
        (key :name r :type number))
      (form :name rect
        (key :name w :type number)
        (key :name h :type number))
      (form :name group
        (key :name child :type form
          (form :name dot)))))

  (form :name line
    (key :name from :type vector)
    (key :name to :type vector))

  (form :name circle
    (key :name radius :type number)))

(canvas :shape (circle :r 1))                  ; the local — clean
(canvas :shape (rect :w 1 :h 2))               ; local-only, invisible globally
(canvas :shape (group :child (dot)))           ; a local slot inside a local
(canvas :shape (line :from [0 0] :to [1 1]))   ; the additive global fallback
(canvas :shape (lf/circle :radius 1))          ; qualified — bypasses locals
(circle :radius 1)                             ; the global, at the top level

(canvas :shape (circle :radius 1))             ; the shadow, both halves
(canvas :shape (circle :rr 1))                 ; the misspelling the fix repairs
(canvas :shape (ghost))                        ; neither local nor global
